{"code":"zh-CN","name":"Mandarin","native":"中文","badge":"中","tts":"zh-CN","sheets":[{"id":"C1","mode":"utility","kind":"core","title":"Keep it alive","blurb":"The lines that rescue any conversation. You’ll use these every day, everywhere.","items":[{"id":"c1.1","t":"我听不懂。","say":"wǒ tīng bu dǒng","en":"I don't understand.","ctx":["work","travel","chat"],"lit":"I listen not understand"},{"id":"c1.2","t":"我不知道。","say":"wǒ bù zhīdào","en":"I don't know.","ctx":["work","travel","chat"]},{"id":"c1.3","t":"请等一下。","say":"qǐng děng yíxià","en":"One moment, please.","ctx":["work","shops","phone"],"tags":"wait hold on sec moment","lit":"please wait a-bit"},{"id":"c1.4","t":"请再说一遍。","say":"qǐng zài shuō yí biàn","en":"Please say it again.","ctx":["work","travel","chat"],"tags":"repeat again pardon what"},{"id":"c1.5","t":"请说慢一点。","say":"qǐng shuō màn yìdiǎn","en":"Slower, please.","ctx":["travel","chat"],"tags":"slow slowly speak"},{"id":"c1.6","t":"“…”用中文怎么说？","say":"“…” yòng Zhōngwén zěnme shuō?","en":"How do you say “…” in Chinese?","ctx":["everywhere"],"tags":"word translate"}]},{"id":"C2","mode":"utility","kind":"core","title":"React like you belong","blurb":"Short reactions that make you sound fluent while you listen.","items":[{"id":"c2.1","t":"当然。","say":"dāngrán","en":"Sure. / Of course.","ctx":["work","shops","chat"],"tags":"yes ok okay sure course"},{"id":"c2.2","t":"对。","say":"duì","en":"Exactly. / Right.","ctx":["work","chat"],"tags":"yes right correct agree"},{"id":"c2.3","t":"我觉得是。","say":"wǒ juéde shì","en":"I think so.","ctx":["work","chat"]},{"id":"c2.4","t":"真的吗？","say":"zhēn de ma?","en":"Really?","ctx":["chat"]},{"id":"c2.5","t":"没问题。","say":"méi wèntí","en":"No problem. / No worries.","ctx":["work","travel","chat"],"tags":"welcome fine ok"},{"id":"c2.6","t":"太好了！","say":"tài hǎo le!","en":"Great! / How nice!","ctx":["chat","family"],"tags":"cool awesome nice"}]},{"id":"C3","mode":"utility","kind":"core","title":"Frames","blurb":"Phrases with a blank. Drop in any word you know and you have a new sentence.","items":[{"id":"c3.1","t":"{x}在哪里？","say":"{x} zài nǎlǐ?","en":"Where is {x}?","ctx":["travel","toilets"],"tags":"where find","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"bathroom","fits":["place","work"]},{"id":"c3.2","t":"我要{x}。","say":"wǒ yào {x}","en":"I'd like {x}.","ctx":["food","shops"],"tags":"want like would order get","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"coffee","fits":["thing"]},{"id":"c3.3","t":"有{x}吗？","say":"yǒu {x} ma?","en":"Do you have {x}?","ctx":["shops","food"],"tags":"have any got there","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"water","fits":["thing"]},{"id":"c3.4","t":"请给我{x}。","say":"qǐng gěi wǒ {x}","en":"Please give me {x}.","ctx":["everywhere"],"tags":"please give","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"bill","fits":["thing","work"]},{"id":"c3.5","t":"我得走了。","say":"wǒ děi zǒu le","en":"I have to go.","ctx":["work","plans"],"tags":"must need got"},{"id":"c3.6","t":"我可以{x}吗？","say":"wǒ kěyǐ {x} ma?","en":"Can I {x}?","ctx":["work","travel"],"tags":"can may could allowed","frame":true,"takes":"verb","ex":"comein"}]},{"id":"W","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"work","title":"Work: Slack & meetings","blurb":"Mostly lines you already know, plus two new ones and some words for your blanks.","items":[{"id":"w.1","t":"我看一下。","say":"wǒ kàn yíxià","en":"Let me take a look.","tags":"look into get back"},{"id":"w.2","t":"我有一个会。","say":"wǒ yǒu yí ge huì","en":"I have a meeting.","tags":"busy call"},{"id":"x.W1","t":"辛苦了。","say":"xīnkǔ le","en":"Thanks for your hard work."}],"core":["c1.3","c1.1","c1.2","c1.4","c2.1","c2.2"],"words":["meeting","file","screen","message","tomorrow"]},{"id":"T1","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Eating out","blurb":"Your frames do most of the ordering. A few new lines and some food words.","diet":true,"items":[{"id":"t1.1","t":"辣吗？","say":"là ma?","en":"Is it spicy?","tags":"hot chili"},{"id":"t1.2","t":"不要放洋葱。","say":"bú yào fàng yángcōng","en":"Without onion, please."},{"id":"t1.3","t":"你们有什么推荐？","say":"nǐmen yǒu shénme tuījiàn?","en":"What do you recommend?"},{"id":"t1.4","t":"我不吃肉。","say":"wǒ bù chī ròu","en":"I don't eat meat.","tags":"vegetarian vegan meat"}],"core":["c3.2","c3.4","c3.3","c1.1"],"words":["water","coffee","bill","menu","beer","this"]},{"id":"T2","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Shopping & money","blurb":"Want, have, one moment: all core. Four new lines.","items":[{"id":"t2.1","t":"多少钱？","say":"duōshao qián?","en":"How much is it?","tags":"price cost how much"},{"id":"t2.2","t":"我只是看看。","say":"wǒ zhǐshì kànkan","en":"I'm just looking."},{"id":"t2.3","t":"我要这个。","say":"wǒ yào zhège","en":"I’ll take this."},{"id":"t2.4","t":"可以刷卡吗？","say":"kěyǐ shuākǎ ma?","en":"Can I pay by card?","tags":"credit card cash pay"}],"core":["c3.2","c3.3","c1.3"],"words":["this","bag"]},{"id":"T3","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Getting around","blurb":"Ask with your core frame, then understand the answer.","items":[{"id":"t3.1","t":"远吗？","say":"yuǎn ma?","en":"Is it far?"},{"id":"t3.2","t":"去机场。","say":"qù jīchǎng","en":"To the airport, please. (taxi)","tags":"taxi cab driver"},{"id":"t3.3","t":"左 · 右 · 一直走","say":"zuǒ · yòu · yìzhí zǒu","en":"left · right · straight on","hear":true,"tags":"directions"}],"core":["c3.1","c1.5","c1.4"],"words":["station","airport","hotel"]},{"id":"T4","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Toilets, help & signs","blurb":"Ask with your core frame. New: a few emergency lines and the signs you’ll see.","signs":true,"items":[{"id":"t4.1","t":"救命！","say":"jiùmìng!","en":"Help!","tags":"emergency"},{"id":"t4.2","t":"没有卫生纸。","say":"méiyǒu wèishēngzhǐ","en":"There's no toilet paper."},{"id":"t4.3","t":"我不舒服。","say":"wǒ bù shūfu","en":"I feel sick.","tags":"ill unwell doctor"},{"id":"t4.4","t":"请叫救护车。","say":"qǐng jiào jiùhùchē","en":"Please call an ambulance.","tags":"emergency doctor"}],"core":["c3.1","c3.4","c1.1"],"words":["bathroom","pharmacy","hospital"]},{"id":"F","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"family","title":"Family & small talk","blurb":"Reactions carry the conversation. Four new lines to start one.","items":[{"id":"f.1","t":"很高兴认识你。","say":"hěn gāoxìng rènshi nǐ","en":"Nice to meet you."},{"id":"f.2","t":"你是哪里人？","say":"nǐ shì nǎlǐ rén?","en":"Where are you from?"},{"id":"f.3","t":"你做什么工作？","say":"nǐ zuò shénme gōngzuò?","en":"What do you do (for work)?"},{"id":"f.4","t":"很好吃！","say":"hěn hǎochī!","en":"It's delicious!"}],"core":["c2.1","c2.4","c2.6","c2.3"]},{"id":"B1","mode":"basic","kind":"basic","title":"Hello & basics","blurb":"Greetings, yes and no, please and thanks.","items":[{"id":"b1.1","t":"你好。","say":"nǐ hǎo","en":"Hello.","tags":"hi hey"},{"id":"b1.2","t":"早上好。","say":"zǎoshang hǎo","en":"Good morning."},{"id":"b1.3","t":"你好吗？","say":"nǐ hǎo ma?","en":"How are you?"},{"id":"b1.4","t":"是。· 不是。","say":"shì · bú shì","en":"Yes (it is). · No (it isn’t)."},{"id":"b1.5","t":"请。","say":"qǐng","en":"Please."},{"id":"b1.6","t":"谢谢。","say":"xièxie","en":"Thank you."},{"id":"b1.7","t":"对不起。","say":"duìbuqǐ","en":"Sorry. / Excuse me.","tags":"excuse me pardon apologize"},{"id":"b1.8","t":"再见。","say":"zàijiàn","en":"Goodbye.","tags":"bye"}]},{"id":"B2","mode":"basic","kind":"basic","title":"Numbers","blurb":"Enough for prices, times and phone numbers.","items":[{"id":"b2.1","t":"一 · 二 · 三","say":"yī · èr · sān","en":"1 · 2 · 3"},{"id":"b2.2","t":"四 · 五 · 六","say":"sì · wǔ · liù","en":"4 · 5 · 6"},{"id":"b2.3","t":"七 · 八 · 九","say":"qī · bā · jiǔ","en":"7 · 8 · 9"},{"id":"b2.4","t":"十 · 二十 · 一百","say":"shí · èrshí · yìbǎi","en":"10 · 20 · 100"},{"id":"x.B21","t":"妈 · 麻 · 马 · 骂","say":"mā · má · mǎ · mà","en":"mum · hemp · horse · scold (the four tones)"}]},{"id":"B3","mode":"basic","kind":"blueprint","title":"Blueprint","blurb":"How the language works, on one page. Spot the pattern; skip the rulebook.","items":[{"id":"b3.1","t":"苹果很红。","say":"píngguǒ hěn hóng","en":"The apple is red.","note":"adjectives act like verbs · 很 links them"},{"id":"b3.2","t":"我吃苹果。","say":"wǒ chī píngguǒ","en":"I eat the apple.","note":"same order as English · no “a / the”"},{"id":"b3.3","t":"我吃了苹果。","say":"wǒ chī le píngguǒ","en":"I ate the apple.","note":"了 = it happened · verbs never change"},{"id":"b3.4","t":"我想吃苹果。","say":"wǒ xiǎng chī píngguǒ","en":"I want to eat the apple.","note":"想 + verb = want to"},{"id":"b3.5","t":"你吃苹果吗？","say":"nǐ chī píngguǒ ma?","en":"Do you eat apples?","note":"add 吗 to ask yes/no"}]}],"words":[{"id":"bathroom","t":"洗手间","say":"xǐshǒujiān","en":"the bathroom","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"toilet restroom washroom wc loo"},{"id":"pharmacy","t":"药店","say":"yàodiàn","en":"the pharmacy","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"drugstore chemist medicine"},{"id":"hospital","t":"医院","say":"yīyuàn","en":"the hospital","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"doctor emergency"},{"id":"station","t":"车站","say":"chēzhàn","en":"the station","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"train metro subway"},{"id":"airport","t":"机场","say":"jīchǎng","en":"the airport","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"flight plane"},{"id":"hotel","t":"酒店","say":"jiǔdiàn","en":"the hotel","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"room stay"},{"id":"water","t":"水","say":"shuǐ","en":"water","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"drink"},{"id":"coffee","t":"咖啡","say":"kāfēi","en":"a coffee","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"cafe drink"},{"id":"bill","t":"账单","say":"zhàngdān","en":"the bill","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"check pay receipt"},{"id":"menu","t":"菜单","say":"càidān","en":"the menu","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"food order"},{"id":"beer","t":"啤酒","say":"píjiǔ","en":"a beer","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"drink alcohol"},{"id":"this","t":"这个","say":"zhège","en":"this one","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"that one"},{"id":"bag","t":"袋子","say":"dàizi","en":"a bag","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"plastic bag"},{"id":"meeting","t":"会议","say":"huìyì","en":"the meeting","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"call standup zoom"},{"id":"file","t":"文件","say":"wénjiàn","en":"the file","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"document doc"},{"id":"screen","t":"屏幕","say":"píngmù","en":"the screen","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"share screen"},{"id":"message","t":"消息","say":"xiāoxi","en":"the message","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"slack text dm"},{"id":"tomorrow","t":"明天","say":"míngtiān","en":"tomorrow","kind":"time"},{"id":"leave","t":"走","say":"zǒu","en":"go","kind":"verb","tags":"leave go"},{"id":"comein","t":"进来","say":"jìnlái","en":"come in","kind":"verb","tags":"enter"},{"id":"pay","t":"付钱","say":"fù qián","en":"pay","kind":"verb","tags":"card cash"}],"diet":{"title":"过敏 · 请看","ask":"这道菜里有这些吗？","askEn":"Does this dish contain any of these?","thanks":"谢谢！","note":"Peanut oil is common in Chinese cooking. Ask about the oil too.","options":{"peanut":{"label":"Peanut allergy","t":"我对花生严重过敏，不能吃花生和花生油。","en":"I have a severe peanut allergy. I can't eat peanuts or peanut oil."},"shellfish":{"label":"Shellfish allergy","t":"我对海鲜（虾、蟹、贝类）过敏。","en":"I have a severe shellfish allergy (shrimp, crab, shellfish)."},"gluten":{"label":"No gluten","t":"我不能吃麸质（小麦）。","en":"I can't eat gluten (wheat)."},"vegetarian":{"label":"No meat or fish","t":"我吃素，不吃肉、鸡肉和鱼。","en":"I don't eat meat, chicken or fish."},"pork":{"label":"No pork","t":"我不吃猪肉。","en":"I don't eat pork."}}},"signs":[{"t":"洗手间 · 厕所","en":"Restrooms"},{"t":"男 · 女","en":"Men · Women"},{"t":"出口 · 入口","en":"Exit · Entrance"},{"t":"推 · 拉","en":"Push · Pull"},{"t":"安全出口","en":"Emergency exit"}]}